LICENCE AND RIGHTS NOTICE
=========================

This repository contains material from more than one author. The public-domain dedication below
applies ONLY to this project's own original work. It is not, and cannot be, a grant over anyone
else's copyright. See NOTICE.md for the provenance breakdown.


1. WHAT IS DEDICATED TO THE PUBLIC DOMAIN (CC0 1.0)
---------------------------------------------------
The original contributions of this project, namely:

  - the site code (assets/js/**, assets/css/**, index.html)
  - the verification harnesses and scripts written for this project (.github/scripts/**)
  - the analysis, commentary and editorial prose WRITTEN FOR THIS PROJECT
  - this project's own data compilations (content/**), to the extent they are original expression

are dedicated to the public domain under CC0 1.0 Universal:
https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/


2. WHAT IS NOT COVERED, AND IS NOT OURS TO LICENCE
---------------------------------------------------
(a) THIRD-PARTY SOLVER WRITE-UPS AND DOCUMENTATION, vendored into this repository from:

      https://github.com/Naddiseo/gsmgio-5btc-puzzle
      https://github.com/puzzlehunt/gsmgio-5btc-puzzle

    Neither repository carries a licence file. Under copyright law the absence of a licence means
    ALL RIGHTS RESERVED by their respective authors. No licence was granted to this project, and
    this project grants none onward. That material — including the phase write-ups, explanations
    whose structure and wording derive from them, and the image sets mirroring their phase folders
    — is reproduced here for reference, preservation and study, with attribution.

    On request from a copyright holder, their material will be removed promptly.

(b) THE PUZZLE CREATOR'S ARTIFACTS: the puzzle images, the published ciphertext blobs, the hint
    posts and the creators' messages. Copyright remains with their author. This project is not
    affiliated with GSMG or with the puzzle's anonymous creator.

(c) THIRD-PARTY CODE referenced or used, under its own licence terms.


3. WHAT NO ONE OWNS
--------------------
Facts are not subject to copyright: the puzzle's key values, hashes, addresses, ciphertext strings
as data, grid coordinates, transaction ids and dates. Restating a fact infringes nothing. This
section states law, it does not grant anything — and it does not extend to the expression,
selection or arrangement in which someone else first published those facts.


4. IF YOU REUSE THIS
---------------------
Take section 1 freely. For anything in section 2, go to the original authors. NOTICE.md maps which
is which, and the cleanest route to the upstream work is to FORK the upstream repositories rather
than copy from here — forking preserves lineage and attribution, which copying does not.
